{
  "id": "E163",
  "title": "Where is Shanghai Hotel?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-10-25",
  "synopsis": "What do you need to say when you meet an inexperienced taxi driver?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/561/53a492a33cf0d35a3a5c2b8c08d1089888ff6e48.mp3?1508747712",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "上海酒店在哪儿\n\n司机：请问，你去哪儿？\n杰杰：我去上海酒店。\n司机：不好意思，我不知道上海酒店在哪儿。\n杰杰：上海酒店在中山北路 150号。\n司机：在什么路口附近？\n杰杰：在中山北路和南京路的路口附近。",
    "traditional": "上海酒店在哪兒\n\n司機：請問，你去哪兒？\n杰杰：我去上海酒店。\n司機：不好意思，我不知道上海酒店在哪兒。\n杰杰：上海酒店在中山北路 150號。\n司機：在什麼路口附近？\n杰杰：在中山北路和南京路的路口附近。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where is Shanghai Hotel?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "司机：请问，你去哪儿？",
      "traditional": "司機：請問，你去哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "sī jī qǐng wèn nǐ qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: May I ask, where are you headed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我去上海酒店。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我去上海酒店。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ qù shàng hǎi jiǔ diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: I'm going to Shanghai Hotel."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "司机：不好意思，我不知道上海酒店在哪儿。",
      "traditional": "司機：不好意思，我不知道上海酒店在哪兒。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī bù hǎo yì si wǒ bù zhī dào shàng hǎi jiǔ diàn zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Sorry, I don’t know where Shanghai Hotel is."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "杰杰：上海酒店在中山北路 150号。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：上海酒店在中山北路 150號。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié shàng hǎi jiǔ diàn zài zhōng shān běi lù 4 hào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Shanghai Hotel is at No. 150 Zhongshan North Road."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "司机：在什么路口附近？",
      "traditional": "司機：在什麼路口附近？",
      "pinyin": "sī jī zài shén me lù kǒu fù jìn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Which intersection is that close to?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "杰杰：在中山北路和南京路的路口附近。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：在中山北路和南京路的路口附近。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié zài zhōng shān běi lù hé nán jīng lù de lù kǒu fù jìn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: It is close to the intersection of Zhongshan North Road and Nanjing Road."
    }
  ],
